1
00:00:00,567 --> 00:00:06,733
[THEME MUSIC PLAYING]

2
00:00:16,467 --> 00:00:17,767
[PHONE CHIMING]

3
00:00:17,767 --> 00:00:19,600
[JUNE] Meet my family.

4
00:00:20,167 --> 00:00:21,733
<i> The Roses.</i>

5
00:00:21,733 --> 00:00:23,100
<i> Yes.</i>

6
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:24,300
<i> Those Roses!</i>

7
00:00:24,533 --> 00:00:28,600
<i>The owner of the Roses
Restaurant Empire.</i>

8
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:33,267
[QUIRKY MUSIC PLAYING]

9
00:00:33,267 --> 00:00:34,533
<i> However...</i>

10
00:00:34,567 --> 00:00:37,567
<i>they are my very,
very distant relatives.</i>

11
00:00:37,567 --> 00:00:38,667
<i> Like,</i>

12
00:00:39,200 --> 00:00:42,400
<i>as far as Pluto is
to Planet Earth!</i>

13
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:59,300
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

14
00:00:59,300 --> 00:01:00,733
I'm just waiting
for the manager.

15
00:01:00,733 --> 00:01:02,767
- So I'll know who they gave
- Sir! Sir!

16
00:01:02,767 --> 00:01:04,300
- the check to.
- Sir! Sir!

17
00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,367
[PING] Excuse me.

18
00:01:07,300 --> 00:01:08,367
Uh...

19
00:01:08,367 --> 00:01:09,800
Please try our product!

20
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:12,233
I'm sure you'll like it!
You look really stressed.

21
00:01:12,233 --> 00:01:19,167
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]

22
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:28,733
Oh!

23
00:01:29,233 --> 00:01:32,300
Served with our homemade
special Ima-Asim Vinegar!

24
00:01:32,300 --> 00:01:34,033
It's really good!

25
00:01:37,133 --> 00:01:39,233
Sir, I checked the office.

26
00:01:39,233 --> 00:01:42,300
Your brother already got
your check!

27
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:44,467
Here. [PANTING]

28
00:01:50,567 --> 00:01:51,800
[SIGHS HEAVILY]

29
00:01:53,167 --> 00:01:55,167
Please. Fire her.

30
00:01:55,167 --> 00:01:56,733
Hey, I didn't do anything wrong!

31
00:01:56,733 --> 00:01:58,400
Your presentation of the product
is wrong.

32
00:01:58,400 --> 00:02:01,600
You used Pindang Tocino
to promote your business.

33
00:02:07,133 --> 00:02:08,567
You are so--

34
00:02:08,567 --> 00:02:09,867
Fire!

35
00:02:09,867 --> 00:02:16,800
[QUIRKY MUSIC CONTINUES]
